47,2,3,talk,Rin,,We should look at the evening groups that are already working on their own.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The funding shape is the problem, not the total amount available to us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,We need a proposal that uses the existing volunteer base without overloading staff.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I think we should focus on the evening groups that are already active.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, but we must ensure the physical access is not the barrier.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
