53,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,A proposal that relies on the grant for year two is a trap.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,I support a model that leverages the volunteers and extends the hours.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
